==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Easter B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns.
**1 [[Marching Kory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This floor is very similar to the original [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]], but without [[Sunny Celeboodle]], higher magnifications, and also with [[Easter Duche]] and the [[Easter B.B.Bunny]]. The higher magnifications make this level pretty tough, as the enemies have good pushing power, as well as high health and attack. [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]] units such as [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Vendor Cat]] are helpful in pushing back the enemies, and any [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] ubers are always appreciated to have for levels like this.

